ee \u2013 PhD with a specialization in Clinical Psychology\nResearch Degree \u2013 PhD with a specialization in Educational Psychology\nUseful Information to Current Students\nNEWS & EVENTS\nNews\nEvents\nNotice Board\nMedia Contact Directory\nSearch for:\nHome\nAdmission\nResearch Postgraduate\nResearch Postgraduate\nResearch Postgraduate\nThe Department offers a broad range of programmes and is committed to designing the most appropriate learning experiences that suit students\u2019 needs, sharing with them the exciting developments in psychology, and helping them achieve the required level of academic competence. At graduate level there are also opportunities for professional doctorate study in the areas of Clinical Psychology and Educational Psychology, as well as for MPhil and PhD research in the areas of Cognition and perception, Clinical psychology, Educational psychology, Social psychology and the History of psychology. (Programme leaflet)\nMaster of Philosophy (MPhil) & Doctor of Philosophy (PhD)\nPhD with a Specialization in Clinical Psychology\nPhD with a Specialization in Educational Psychology\nPhD in the field of Clinical Psychological Sciences\nPrint\nAdmission\nUndergraduate\nTaught Postgraduate\nMaster of Social Sciences in the field of Applied Psychology\nMaster of Social Sciences in the field of Clinical Psychology\nMaster of Social Sciences in the field of Educational Psychology\nMaster of Social Sciences in the field of Psychology\nDoctor of Psychology in the field of Clinical Psychology\nDoctor of Psychology in the field of Educational Psychology\nResearch Postgraduate\nMaster of Philosophy (MPhil) & Doctor of Philosophy (PhD)\nPhD with a Specialization in Clinical Psychology\nPhD with a Specialization in Educational Psychology\nPhD in the field of Clinical Psychological Sciences\nProgramme Booklet\nCopyright \u00a9 Department of Psychology, HKU. | Privacy | Sitemap\nToggle Sliding Bar Area\nRecently Viewed\nSearch for:\nPage load link\nAdmissi